     "level": "note",
     "message": {
      "text": "Verified that the batch correctly implements the preflight R6 rule, deadlock fix, and test race fix without altering each PR's claims. Cargo check and metadata confirm dev-dependencies correctly evade the R6 cycle check."
     },
